        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>新入手iPad验机流程</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 10px 12px 16px 12px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-banner {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4d6d, #ff6b81);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 4px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .sub-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 4px;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    color: #ff4d6d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    transform: rotate(-10deg);\n  }\n  .sub-bubble {\n    background: #ff8fa3;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 4px 18px;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  td, th {\n    border: 1px solid #f3b6c2;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    word-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n  .header-row th {\n    background: #ff4d6d;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .num-col {\n    width: 8%;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .op-col {\n    width: 52%;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n  }\n  .key-col {\n    width: 40%;\n  }\n  .red-text { color: #e8384f; font-size: 11px; }\n  .green-check { color: #2e8b57; font-weight: bold; }\n  .red-x { color: #e8384f; font-weight: bold; }\n  .full-row td {\n    background: #ffe1e8;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #d6304a;\n  }\n  .pink-cell { background: #fff0f3; }\n  .label-cell {\n    background: #ffd9e2;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;\n  }\n  .bottom-banner {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4d6d, #ff6b81);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 12px 4px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .small-note { font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.3; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-banner\">新入手iPad验机流程</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-row\">\n    <span class=\"arrow\">&#8599;</span>\n    <span class=\"sub-bubble\">简单易懂版</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr class=\"header-row\">\n      <th class=\"num-col\">验机顺序</th>\n      <th class=\"op-col\">具体操作（务必全程录像 ✅）</th>\n      <th class=\"key-col\">重点</th>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-col\">1</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">检查快递箱是否有破损</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">破损马上拒收 联系卖家 ❌</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr class=\"pink-cell\">\n      <td class=\"num-col\">2</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">从快递箱取出包装盒<br>检查外包装塑封膜/ 封条是否破损</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">先别拆盒！在包装盒背面<br>找到序列号(Serial No.后面数字)</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-col\">3</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">打开 checkcoverage.apple.com<br><span class=\"red-text\">输入外包装序列号查询</span></td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"green-check\">显示\"激活您的设备\" ✅</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr class=\"full-row\">\n      <td colspan=\"3\">确认完毕 可以打开包装盒啦 ✅</td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr class=\"pink-cell\">\n      <td class=\"num-col\">4</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">撕开塑封膜开箱 确认资料齐全<br>三包凭证/说明书/苹果贴纸</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">核对序列号\"三码合一\"✅<br>外包装/三包凭证/iPad背后</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"num-col\">5</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">检查数据线有无使用痕迹<br>确认充电头插脚朝上(背向数据线)</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">插头方向不对 可能被拆封过 ❌</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr class=\"pink-cell\">\n      <td class=\"num-col\">6</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">检查机身、屏幕是否有划痕硌碰<br>桌面放平 查看机身是否弯曲<br>在光源下检查摄像头内部有无灰尘</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">一定要仔细检查摄像头噝 ❌</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr class=\"full-row\">\n      <td colspan=\"3\">确认完毕 拿出iPad本体 开机激活 ✅</td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">屏幕检查</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">按压屏幕 检查是否有严重水波纹<br>打开备忘录 检查是否有黑点、角落漏光</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">发现问题及时联系商家 ❌</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr class=\"pink-cell\">\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">相机检查</td>\n      <td class=\"op-col\">拍一张全黑照片 检查是否有亮点<br>录制一段视频 检查录音和画面是否正常</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"red-text\">发现问题及时联系商家 ❌</span></td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"op-col\">打开设置-通用-关于本机</td>\n      <td class=\"key-col\"><span class=\"green-check\">查看保修日期是不是一年 ✅</span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-banner\">全部确认完毕，安全下车✅</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
